# Patterns to ignore when packaging the Helm chart.
# NOTE: deliberately does NOT exclude `charts/` or `*.tgz` — this monorepo
# vendors subcharts into charts/ at release time (`helm dependency build`), and
# excluding them here makes Helm report the dep as "missing" at load time.
# Git exclusion of vendored subcharts + Chart.lock is handled at commit time
# (charts/*/charts/ and charts/*/*.tgz are in the repo-root .gitignore; Chart.lock
# is removed before commit — this cell is a draft, its lock is not durable state).
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.tmproj
*.bak
*.orig
*~
